  <Comments>===========================================
 Game Title    : X4 Foundations (Tides of Avarice)
 Game Version  : 5.10 (476551)
 Game Sponsor  : PF
 Process Name  : X4.exe
 Relevant Info : 64bits/Space Sim
 Script Version: 3.2 (AOB)
 CE Version    : 7.4
 Release date  : 07-Apr-2022
 Author        : Recifense
 History:
 01-Dec-2018: First Release (for version 1.00)(s1.0)
 01-Dec-2018: Release for version 1.10. (s1.1 AOB)
 02-Dec-2018: Fix for Identifying Ship and "Unlimited Missile" (s2.0)
 03-Dec-2018: Include all human player's ships in GM/SM/SS* (s2.1)
 05-Dec-2018: Release for version 1.21. (s2.2 AOB) + Change in MPI/MPS
 21-Dec-2018: Release for version 1.50. (s2.3 AOB)
 27-Feb-2019: Release for version 2.00. (s2.4 AOB)
 18-Mar-2019: Release for version 2.20. (s2.5 AOB)
 28-May-2019: Release for version 2.50. (s2.6 AOB)
 17-Oct-2019: Release for version 2.60. (s2.7 AOB)
 18-Nov-2019: Release for version 3.00. (s2.8 AOB) (beta)
 21-Nov-2019: Release for version 3.00. (s2.9 AOB) (beta)
 23-Jan-2020: Release for version 3.00. (s2.10 AOB) (beta5)
 04-Mar-2020: Release for version 3.00. (s2.11 AOB) (Beta6)
 02-Apr-2020: Release for version 3.00.393143 (s2.12 AOB)(Split Vandetta)
 10-Apr-2020: Release for version 3.10.394044 (s2.13 AOB)
 04-Jun-2020: Release for version 3.20.400261 (s2.14 AOB)
 30-Jul-2020: Release for version 3.30.406216 (s2.15 AOB)
 17-Mar-2021: Release for version 4.00.432831 (s2.16 AOB)
 13-Sep-2021: Release for version 4.10.458643 (s2.17 AOB)(Craddle of Humanity)
 27-Dec-2021: Release for version 4.20.465891 (s2.18 AOB)
 06-Jan-2022: Trying to fix crash point (s2.19 AOB)
 09-Jan-2022: Trying to fix another crash point (s2.20 AOB)
 15-Mar-2022: Release for version 5.00.475121 (s3.0 AOB)(Tides of Avarice)
 27-Mar-2022: Release for version 5.00.475603 + crash point fix (s3.1 AOB)
 07-Apr-2022: Release for version 5.10.476551 (s3.2 AOB)
 Features:
 - Minimum Money      [1]
 - Full Hull (GM)     [2]
 - Full Shield        [3]
 - Unlimited Missiles [4] (new)(s2.0)
 - Some Pointers
===========================================
[1] For human player only:
[2] For human player's controlled ship;
[3] For human player's controlled ship;
[4] For human player's controlled ship;
===========================================
[USAGE]
1) Run CE70 or greater;
2) Run Game;
3) Load the game process "X4.exe" in CE;
4) Load this table and activate the main script;
5) Now Activate the script of each cheat you want to use;
6) Game On;
===========================================
[HOTKEYS]
- See description on the table entries;
===========================================
[ADVICE]
When you can,save the game before starting using table/cheat. So you can always come back in case you don't like the result.
===========================================
[INFO]
Tested on Win 10 64bits
===========================================
Cheers!
</Comments>
